profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"What is not working?","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-06T05:11:34.927Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6892e44cc23f749e7039ed53","commentBy":{"_id":"680951746d078cab6bdd6fa9","username":"Al3xanderrr_","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-04-23T20:45:40.963Z","lastActive":"2025-08-31T17:37:05.274Z","status":"offline","id":"680951746d078cab6bdd6fa9","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"The script should work, all you gotta do is enable it and it should win most of the rounds (i cant seem to find a way to stop it from dying to temperature and acid rain and some other events that i didnt work on.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-06T05:12:44.275Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"689638e8b504d17ff382eec5","commentBy":{"_id":"66e041eb3cc1d71468e1c4e7","username":"thxqus","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/16355bc5bc38614aedc8f585e0d5470c34de5d00884ada0c14e95ea2d357c77f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66e041eb3cc1d71468e1c4e7-1786277862964.jpg"},"createdAt":"2024-09-10T12:56:11.178Z","lastActive":"2026-08-22T13:29:47.253Z","status":"offline","id":"66e041eb3cc1d71468e1c4e7","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/16355bc5bc38614aedc8f585e0d5470c34de5d00884ada0c14e95ea2d357c77f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66e041eb3cc1d71468e1c4e7-1786277862964.jpg"}},"text":"@Al3xanderrr_ I'm guessing it doesn't work because the safezone you go to while autofarming might not have a roof to block the acid rain, and maybe the same goes for the blizzard (or because it's not close enough to a wall). I suggest having the autofarm teleport you to the spawn, specifically in the kitchen, since it has a roof and nearby walls that might protect you from acid rain and blizzard. You could also set it to loop teleport you back there after being teleported to the map, and maybe freeze the player in position, or add a toggle for freezing and looping teleport. But the priority should be changing the safezone/autofarm location to the spawn's kitchen, as it seems safer.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-08T17:50:32.517Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"68ed00cafc6cc461855cf62d","commentBy":{"_id":"68ec1d665e6bd3596dbc188d","username":"Elio","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/86cdcb7359a948b021043ba2ebc08e73af697cab46c04fc79687614337ccc6ac.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68ec1d665e6bd3596dbc188d-1760304526787.jpg"},"createdAt":"2025-10-12T21:28:06.004Z","lastActive":"2025-12-10T16:44:08.819Z","status":"offline","id":"68ec1d665e6bd3596dbc188d","topMilestone":{"key":"account.years","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/86cdcb7359a948b021043ba2ebc08e73af697cab46c04fc79687614337ccc6ac.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68ec1d665e6bd3596dbc188d-1760304526787.jpg"}},"text":"When i to to the safe zone it makes me die","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-10-13T13:38:18.179Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}